{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Extend MapLibre iOS with native code."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"name":"Warning","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The plugin API is experimental and does not yet have stability guarantees."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"warning"},{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MapLibre Native has a C plugin API for extending it with native code. Currently, plugins can add style layer types. After a plugin registers its layer types, styles can use them like the built-in layer types, for example "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"type\": \"ngon\""},{"type":"text","text":". Layers of plugin types appear as "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MLNStyle.layers"},{"type":"text","text":". The API is defined in "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/include\/mln\/plugin\/plugin_api.h"},{"type":"text","text":", which documents the ownership and threading rules that plugins must follow."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A plugin describes a layer type with the structures of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"plugin_api.h"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The name of the layer type, as used for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"type\""},{"type":"text","text":" in a style."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The paint properties of the layer, with their type, default value and the kinds of expressions they accept."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The shaders of the layer. On iOS, which renders with Metal, a plugin provides the complete Metal Shading Language source with its entry points."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Callbacks that turn the features of a tile into vertex data, update the uniforms of the shaders and answer queries for rendered features."}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Add-MapLibre-with-the-plugin-API","type":"heading","text":"Add MapLibre with the plugin API","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only the build of MapLibre iOS distributed as the Swift package "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-ios-with-plugin-api"},{"type":"text","text":" exports the plugin API. Apart from that, it is the same as the standard build, and applications keep using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import MapLibre"},{"type":"text","text":". Use it instead of the standard package, not in addition to it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The package has two products:"}]},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Product"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use it in"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Contents"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MapLibre"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Applications"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MapLibre.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" with the plugin API enabled."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MapLibrePluginApi"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Plugin packages"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The C plugin API, included as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<mln\/plugin\/plugin_api.h>"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]]]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The GitHub release of each MapLibre iOS version also includes a static XCFramework of this build, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MapLibre.static.plugins.xcframework.zip"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"Write-a-plugin","type":"heading","text":"Write a plugin","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A plugin package depends only on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MapLibrePluginApi"},{"type":"text","text":", so the application decides which MapLibre framework it links. Both products come from the same package, so Swift Package Manager resolves the header and the framework to the same version."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["dependencies: [","    .package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-ios-with-plugin-api\", exact: \"<version>\"),","],","targets: [","    \/\/ Application","    .target(name: \"App\", dependencies: [.product(name: \"MapLibre\", package: \"maplibre-ios-with-plugin-api\")]),","    \/\/ Plugin","    .target(name: \"MyLayer\", dependencies: [.product(name: \"MapLibrePluginApi\", package: \"maplibre-ios-with-plugin-api\")]),","]"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the plugin does not link MapLibre, it does not call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mln_plugin_register_v1"},{"type":"text","text":" itself. Instead it exposes a function that receives the registration function and passes its descriptor to it:"}]},{"syntax":"c","type":"codeListing","code":["#include <mln\/plugin\/plugin_api.h>","","mln_plugin_status my_layer_register(mln_plugin_register_function_v1 register_plugin,","                                    char *error_message,","                                    size_t error_message_capacity) {","    if (!register_plugin) return MLN_PLUGIN_STATUS_NOT_FOUND;","    return register_plugin(&descriptor, error_message, error_message_capacity);","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Here "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"descriptor"},{"type":"text","text":" is the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mln_plugin_descriptor_v1"},{"type":"text","text":" of the plugin. Set "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"struct_size"},{"type":"text","text":" of every structure to the size of its type, as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"plugin_api.h"},{"type":"text","text":" describes."}]},{"anchor":"Register-a-plugin","type":"heading","text":"Register a plugin","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The application passes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mln_plugin_register_v1"},{"type":"text","text":" to the plugin. Register all plugins before creating a map that loads a style using their layer types:"}]},{"syntax":"objc","type":"codeListing","code":["#import <MapLibre\/MapLibre.h>","#include \"my_layer.hpp\" \/\/ includes <mln\/plugin\/plugin_api.h>","","char error[512] = {};","mln_plugin_status status = my_layer_register(&mln_plugin_register_v1, error, sizeof(error));","if (status != MLN_PLUGIN_STATUS_OK && status != MLN_PLUGIN_STATUS_ALREADY_REGISTERED) {","    NSLog(@\"Failed to register plugin: %s\", error);","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Registration is process-wide and thread-safe. Registering the same plugin again returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MLN_PLUGIN_STATUS_ALREADY_REGISTERED"},{"type":"text","text":". Plugins cannot be unregistered."}]},{"anchor":"Example","type":"heading","text":"Example","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/tree\/main\/plugins\/ngon-layer"},{"type":"text","text":" in the repository is an example plugin. It draws regular polygons at point features and registers the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ngon"},{"type":"text","text":" layer type with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mln_ngon_layer_register"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Plugin API","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Advanced","identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/CustomStyleLayerExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/RenderingStatisticsHud"],"anchor":"Advanced","generated":true}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/PluginAPI","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/pluginapi"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"title":"MapLibre","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyleLayer":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstylelayer","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNStyleLayer","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyleLayer","abstract":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyleLayer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is an abstract base class for style layers. A style layer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"manages the layout and appearance of content at a specific z-index in a style."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object consists of one or more "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" objects."}],"title":"MLNStyleLayer"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","abstract":[{"text":"The proxy object for the current map style.","type":"text"}],"title":"MLNStyle"},"https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native/blob/main/include/mln/plugin/plugin_api.h":{"title":"plugin_api.h","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/include\/mln\/plugin\/plugin_api.h","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/include\/mln\/plugin\/plugin_api.h","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"plugin_api.h"}]},"https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native/tree/main/plugins/ngon-layer":{"title":"n-gon layer","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/tree\/main\/plugins\/ngon-layer","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/tree\/main\/plugins\/ngon-layer","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n-gon layer"}]},"https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-ios-with-plugin-api":{"title":"maplibre-ios-with-plugin-api","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-ios-with-plugin-api","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-ios-with-plugin-api","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"maplibre-ios-with-plugin-api"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/CustomStyleLayerExample":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/customstylelayerexample","kind":"article","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/CustomStyleLayerExample","type":"topic","title":"Custom Style Layers (Metal API)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creating a Custom Style Layer with Metal"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/RenderingStatisticsHud":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/renderingstatisticshud","kind":"article","type":"topic","role":"article","title":"Rendering Statistics HUD","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/RenderingStatisticsHud","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Show rendering statistics on the map"}]}}}